Package: PredLDA
Type: Package
Title: Predictive Linear Discriminant Analysis with an R6 Interface
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ryan", "Ducret", email = "ryanducret@live.fr", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Implements predictive linear discriminant analysis (LDA) through an
    R6 class whose interface follows the 'scikit-learn' conventions: fit(),
    predict(), predict_proba(), print() and summary(). The target variable may
    have two or more classes and the linear classification functions
    (one per class) are exposed for interpretation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    R6
Suggests:
    MASS
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
